{"action_ordinal":2,"episode_id":"r1ep-a4b52036ca9afb99e9515032207afa54","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0002","observation_sha256":"82ba8f0c20b22898434774f4522a1cbb628d53060072badb85c58e440b2821b2","ordinal":2,"provider_round":2,"question_sha256":"75f53641c147dad20c9df6afe68f29cb4400ba58343fbaab532dcd0d4d497bf5","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":2,"episode_id":"r1ep-a4b52036ca9afb99e9515032207afa54","key_id":"0f926bcca65bd6a493d57055dbb73cb3081487fb7be1d47185f8f733a313e307","ordinal":2,"provider_round":2,"question_sha256":"75f53641c147dad20c9df6afe68f29cb4400ba58343fbaab532dcd0d4d497bf5","receipt_mac":"1438e3bbc80214ee0d550cd4a73e35accd8415dea9b3ae2836f36f86f3d7b28a","result_sha256":"f5dc39db8e2f2849890bfef1b36d7e856ddcd9caf10f85ed94bacfcf5c11d1fb","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"fb38c6c1d50aeae07cd391df0e916f04520cf904ce68add77202a37c1102d1f9"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"case_sensitive":false,"max_results":80,"path":"/memories","pattern":"producer|festival"},"content":"/memories/session-02.md:L34: Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Doing good. Last weekend, I went to a music festival in Boston - it was awesome! So many cool bands playing and the atmosphere was electric. I love music, it reminded me why I love it. Here's a pic, take a look.\n/memories/session-03.md:L18: Calvin: Hey Dave! The festival in Tokyo was awesome! Didn't see any bands, but met lots of talented artists and industry people. Totally enriching!\n/memories/session-03.md:L30: Calvin: The producer gave me some advice to stay true to myself and sound unique. It got me thinking about where I want my music to go. It's really motivating!\n/memories/session-15.md:L22: Calvin: Thanks, Dave! I had the opportunity to meet Frank Ocean at a music festival in Tokyo and we clicked. We've been speaking and sharing ideas we arranged a meeting and recorded a song in the studio at my mansion - it's been great!\n/memories/session-15.md:L28: Calvin: It was an incredible experience, Dave! The city was buzzing with energy and the festival crowd was so lively - it was like fuel for my soul. Look at this photo, that's amazing!\n/memories/session-15.md:L32: Dave: Wow, that sounds incredible! What was it like playing at the festival? Must have been an amazing experience.\n/memories/session-15.md:L35: Calvin: It was a dream come true, Dave! The festival had buzzing energy and a super upbeat crowd. We all felt connected, it was amazing!\n/memories/session-23.md:L24: Dave: That's a great approach, Cal! Reminding yourself of the passion for the goals and getting help from others is really important. Taking a break and having fun sounds so refreshing. Oh, I just got back from a music festival - it was amazing! The energy, the music, the crowd - sooo good. I felt so alive!\n/memories/session-23.md:L27: Calvin: Wow Dave, sounds awesome! Music festivals bring so much joy and the energy of the crowd can be amazing. Got any photos from the festival? I'd love to check them out and join in on the fun.\n/memories/session-23.md:L37: Dave: The Fireworks headlined the festival.\n/memories/session-24.md:L25: Calvin: It all started August last year when we met at a festival and he said he wanted to collaborate. We clicked right away and the chemistry on stage was incredible. I'm so lucky! Check the photo, of how we perfectly look together on stage!","content_sha256":"b715b742c4d1a19923f90d6f80dc5ee24e3f97271093d8008fdcc94fea6afe9c","coverage":[{"line_end":34,"line_start":34,"path":"/memories/session-02.md"},{"line_end":18,"line_start":18,"path":"/memories/session-03.md"},{"line_end":30,"line_start":30,"path":"/memories/session-03.md"},{"line_end":22,"line_start":22,"path":"/memories/session-15.md"},{"line_end":28,"line_start":28,"path":"/memories/session-15.md"},{"line_end":32,"line_start":32,"path":"/memories/session-15.md"},{"line_end":35,"line_start":35,"path":"/memories/session-15.md"},{"line_end":24,"line_start":24,"path":"/memories/session-23.md"},{"line_end":27,"line_start":27,"path":"/memories/session-23.md"},{"line_end":37,"line_start":37,"path":"/memories/session-23.md"},{"line_end":25,"line_start":25,"path":"/memories/session-24.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":11,"result_sha256":"f5dc39db8e2f2849890bfef1b36d7e856ddcd9caf10f85ed94bacfcf5c11d1fb","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"grep","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":true},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679"}
